Subject: [PATCH] Preserve SSC accelerometer device coordinates

SSC accelerometer events are already factory calibrated and oriented to the
Android device frame. Attribute 20 is placement metadata, not a residual
sample transform. Remove the extra multiplication and erroneous parsing of
placement as nine consecutive rotation entries. Keep the public property as
identity for ABI compatibility.

Protocol reference (Handling stream events, item 3):
https://git.martb.dev/MartB/vendor_oneplus_kebab/src/commit/6694ebe6754e2d70cbf98aba495ad43396a21385/proprietary/vendor/etc/sensors/proto/sns_accel.proto
Placement attribute:
https://git.martb.dev/MartB/vendor_oneplus_kebab/src/commit/6694ebe6754e2d70cbf98aba495ad43396a21385/proprietary/vendor/etc/sensors/proto/sns_std_sensor.proto

Local change against libssc v0.4.4; no imported upstream patch.

